    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary tree</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DFS / BFS</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/invert-binary-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 226</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Invert Binary Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Mirror both subtrees, then hang them on opposite sides. One visit per node, O(1) work each: O(n) time, O(h) stack. Any traversal order works, recursive or with an explicit stack or queue, because every node's swap is independent of every other node's.</p>\n"
